{"parse": {"title": "Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them", "pageid": 77158886, "redirects": [], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them</b> may refer to:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic_Beasts_and_Where_to_Find_Them_(book)\" title=\"Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them (book)\"><i>Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them</i> (book)</a>, a 2001 book by J. K. Rowling</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic_Beasts_and_Where_to_Find_Them_(film)\" title=\"Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them (film)\"><i>Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them</i> (film)</a>, a 2016 film by David Yates\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic_Beasts_and_Where_to_Find_Them_(soundtrack)\" title=\"Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them (soundtrack)\"><i>Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them</i> (soundtrack)</a>, a 2016 soundtrack album by James Newton Howard</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"See_also\">See also</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Fantastic_Beasts_and_Where_to_Find_Them&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic_Beasts_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Fantastic Beasts (disambiguation)\">Fantastic Beasts (disambiguation)</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Topics referred to by the same term</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1374546851\">.mw-parser-output .dmbox{display:flex;align-items:center;clear:both;margin:0.9em 1em;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color-subtle,#c8ccd1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color-subtle,#c8ccd1);padding:0.25em 0.35em;font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output .dmbox>*{flex-shrink:0;margin:0 0.25em}